\f0\b \cf7 \cb8 \strokec7 Executive Summary:
\f2\b0  The Commons represent 256 acres of irreplaceable natural assets, ancient sandstone crags, and living heritage across Royal Tunbridge Wells and Rusthall. As the charity pursues freehold community ownership, our website must serve as our most trusted, resilient, and persuasive civic asset.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf7 \cb8 At present, administrative fragility (demonstrated by recent styling breakdowns) and mobile friction limit our reach and strain volunteer time. This proposal outlines a focused modernisation for a fixed one-off investment of 
\f0\b \'a31,000
\f2\b0  with 
\f0\b \'a30 ongoing software fees
\f2\b0 , built around three core pillars.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \strokec3 PILLAR 1: ELIMINATING ADMINISTRATIVE FRICTION & VOLUNTEER ANXIETY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \AppleTypeServices \cf7 \strokec7 From fragile visual page builders to stress-free, form-based publishing.
\f2\i0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf7 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 The Operational Vulnerability:
\f2\b0  The current site relies on a brittle WordPress and Elementor setup where design structure and content are interlinked. Routine edits to news posts or events risk corrupting layouts, distorting mobile styling, or breaking global CSS stylesheets (as recently occurred with missing files that disabled public styling). This causes acute stress for administrative volunteers, creates delays in publishing notices, and requires outside technical intervention.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 The Modern Solution (Dedicated Charity Editorial Portal):
\f2\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf7 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 Simple Form-Field Entry:
\f2\b0  Trustees and volunteers update News, Notices, and Events by simply typing into clear boxes (Title, Date, Description, Photo) and clicking "Publish".\
\ls1\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 Guaranteed Unbreakable Formatting:
\f2\b0  Visual styling, fonts, and mobile responsiveness are hardcoded. It is physically impossible for an editor to break page layout, misalign text, or delete styling.\
\ls1\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 Zero Maintenance Overhead:
\f2\b0  Eliminates plugin update conflicts, security vulnerabilities, and recurring monthly maintenance agency retainers.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

