\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 The Audience Challenge:
\f2\b0  Over 70% of visits occur on mobile devices. When families, walkers, and dog owners visit the Commons, the current website makes it difficult to quickly find parking near Wellington Rocks or Toad Rock, accessible trail routes, or seasonal notices.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 The Modern Solution:
\f2\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf7 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 Mobile-First Visitor Guide:
\f2\b0  Fast-loading interactive trail guides, walking routes, and parking directions tailored for smartphone users out on the commons.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 Local Economy & Tourism Synergy:
\f2\b0  Curated routes connecting the Commons directly to The Pantiles, Spa Valley Railway, High Rocks, and heritage local pubs\'97fostering local business backing and community pride.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 Search Engine Dominance (SEO):
\f2\b0  Clean, high-performance architecture ensures top Google ranking for high-volume searches such as 
\f1\i "Tunbridge Wells circular walks"
\f2\i0 , 
\f1\i "Toad Rock parking"
\f2\i0 , and 
\f1\i "things to do in Tunbridge Wells"
\f2\i0 , funneling hundreds of prospective supporters to the charity every month.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

