\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 One-Touch Mobile Membership & Gift Aid:
\f2\b0  Frictionless sign-up flow supporting Apple Pay, Google Pay, and card payments, allowing residents to join for \'a315/year in under 30 seconds with automated Gift Aid collection.\
\ls3\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec7 Accessible Community Pledging:
\f2\b0  An inviting pledge gateway starting from an accessible \'a320 tier that collects pledges of support without taking immediate payment.\
